    <element xsi:type="archimate:ArchimateDiagramModel" name="UC3 Capability SWOT Matrix (6months)" id="id-a7fca2cafa434f1d809310df28e3c9d5">
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-0e0a0571d61a4eb2bac7779aa4485e8e" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="6" y="15" width="150" height="28"/>
        <content>Capability (status at 6 months)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-a13b66a79b8f4a8bb21d686c57ad01a3" fillColor="#e2efda">
        <bounds x="164" y="15" width="205" height="28"/>
        <content>Strengths (internal)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-598ece387869499aa3a781277bdbd2d4" fillColor="#fce4d6">
        <bounds x="375" y="15" width="205" height="28"/>
        <content>Weaknesses (internal)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-0de7674139c34db587ede8afa4264d3e" fillColor="#ddebf7">
        <bounds x="586" y="15" width="205" height="28"/>
        <content>Opportunities (external)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-6d856da348654d6e8697a89875163f0a" fillColor="#fff2cc">
        <bounds x="797" y="15" width="205" height="28"/>
        <content>Threats (external)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-adf4f69d800c4acc89bb3921761db254" fillColor="#c6e0b4" archimateElement="id-3b7ef3b72c7247279ac1e92082acb55c">
        <bounds x="6" y="49" width="150" height="82"/>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-28a2f3eb1fba46e3a0b32fdc44df4c8f" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="164" y="49" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• All carriers in one app (carrier-neutral)
• Works without carrier deals (APIs + e-mail)</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-f45ca9bb182c4ebf8792bd728a613cd7" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="375" y="49" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• E-mail parsing less reliable than APIs
• Few users right after launch</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-1cf48992d38647aab0855c62f9d4373a" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="586" y="49" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Growing online parcel volume
• More carriers open tracking APIs</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-22f4981c6f1c4b6bad1b78da858695c4" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="797" y="49" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Carriers may limit API access
• Carrier apps add multi-carrier tracking</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-7582f7b769014d8594199d5d984f6055" fillColor="#f4b183" archimateElement="id-c3a2d06bdae14f4d9a42b03e8667e16a">
        <bounds x="6" y="137" width="150" height="82"/>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-1529bc90ddf7496b87915e4c05977131" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="164" y="137" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Privacy by design: opt-in, user controls data
• Parcel history of bundling users</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-349382e33d6848c8a057527e8ec5284c" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="375" y="137" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• No recipient profiles yet
• No onboarding or consent flow yet</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-76a0dccae4094247890498b36cbad44b" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="586" y="137" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Each profile improves the advice (network effect)
• Recipients want fewer missed deliveries</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-96528662a9954a75a02bb095be0ab2c3" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="797" y="137" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Recipients reluctant to share when they are home
• GDPR limits how profile data may be used</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-c04fe2732c724057aee54cc277e0bf21" fillColor="#e6e6e6" archimateElement="id-032c7dd52fa04e389d3c3ca8364e7bea">
        <bounds x="6" y="225" width="150" height="82"/>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-c02cdf35a05441ac9c9a4ff2c46e92d5" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="164" y="225" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Unique mix of all-carrier data and profiles
• Clear target: fewer missed first attempts</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-ded89db824fd4e70bc02d5f7ddef0a1b" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="375" y="225" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• No decision model or delivery history
• No data science skills yet</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-032a23190fa84d189d288c48af7e805e" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="586" y="225" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Carriers and webshops want lower cost per parcel
• Better analytics and AI tools</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-e5acbff6048242afae4c816aa7c33781" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="797" y="225" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Carriers build their own optimisation
• Wrong advice damages recipients’ trust</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:DiagramObject" id="id-e512c2aa373440aaa0a6b67dc414f001" fillColor="#fff2cc" archimateElement="id-019bbfca609d4c74b0073db3a99b25fc">
        <bounds x="6" y="313" width="150" height="82"/>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-0fe4870ce4254ff5a6de21a86d6f6d81" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="164" y="313" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Neutral party between carriers
• Clear value: saving per optimised parcel</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-189b030d09db4631a71c65fee1347818" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="375" y="313" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• No sales team or partner contracts
• No proof of savings yet</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-586f29feae7e4c998b263a3d22176795" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="586" y="313" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Webshops want better delivery options at checkout
• Pickup points want more parcels</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-35c40b84010f4eeda9d96add6a825387" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="797" y="313" width="205" height="82"/>
        <content>• Carriers see OnTrack as a rival for the customer
• Long B2B sales cycles</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-afbe7d82834d4549af283981b300e049" fillColor="#f4b183">
        <bounds x="6" y="405" width="150" height="50"/>
        <content>Selected for operating model</content>
      </child>
      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-ee21b4c084bd42c99fe7415719ae2146" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#ffffff">
        <bounds x="164" y="405" width="838" height="50"/>
        <content>Insight: recipient profiling is the bottleneck. Its weaknesses (no profiles, no consent flow) and threats (privacy) block delivery optimisation and partnering, while its opportunity (network effect) is the core of our Valuable Competitive Position. → Operating model for Recipient onboarding and Consent management.</content>
      </child>
    </element>
